@title Walk-through with a closed-loop winch: an STO channel coil opens while the hook rises and the drive trips with the discrepancy code
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
@area Simulate
# Lane L2c. The project has one saved walk-through (press up step 1, open the coil of STO channel 1, expect
# the drive to be tripped with STD and the hook to stand). Simulate > Defects and walk-throughs lists it.
open qa/fixtures/closed-winch-walk.novo
wait 20
click_text Simulate
wait 5
click_text "Defects and walk-throughs"
wait 30
expect "STO channel 1 opens while lifting"
shot card-with-the-saved-walk-through
click_text "▶ Run"
wait 300
expect "2 passed, 0 failed"
shot report
check_layout
